# Raw archives, executables, Azure responses, and full logs are local evidence.
# Commit only the compact, sanitized summaries/checksums beside this file.
*-raw/
azure-*-response*.json
azure-*-response*.json.tmp.*
# Run-specific Azure staging drivers contain disposable resource names and are
# retained only with the local raw evidence. Reusable logic lives in
# tools/ci-bench/a3/ and the workflow prototype.
azure-*.sh
azure-*.ps1
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.exe
*.log
